        <item>
            <title>0.12.2</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 22:50:14 +0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>0.12.2</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.12.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in 0.12.2</h2>
<ul>
<li>The blur behind the menu is new: it now grows out from the menu&#x27;s centre when the menu opens, its frost is tuned directly (blur radius, colour saturation, resolution — the same technique Monocle uses, so colours stay vivid instead of greying out), and the default strength / grain / tint are the designed ones. If you never touched those three sliders, yours follow; a hand-tuned veil stays</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
